1
00:00:00,804 --> 00:00:02,474
[PANTING]
Leonard.

2
00:00:02,639 --> 00:00:04,469
(Sheldon:)Leonard!

3
00:00:04,641 --> 00:00:06,351
(Leonard(entering):)Hey, what's the matter?

4
00:00:06,518 --> 00:00:08,728
(Sheldon:)Equations.
Someone's tampered with my equations.

5
00:00:08,895 --> 00:00:10,145
- Are you sure?
- Of course.

6
00:00:10,313 --> 00:00:12,733
Look at the beta function
of quantum chromodynamics.

7
00:00:12,899 --> 00:00:14,989
(Sheldon:)The sign's been changed.

8
00:00:15,152 --> 00:00:16,482
(Leonard:)Oh, yeah.

9
00:00:16,653 --> 00:00:19,033
(Leonard:)But doesn't that fix the problem
you've been having?

10
00:00:19,197 --> 00:00:21,487
(Sheldon:)Are you insane?
Are you out of your mind?

11
00:00:21,658 --> 00:00:25,038
Are you...? Hey, look, that fixes
the problem I've been having.

12
00:00:26,163 --> 00:00:28,043
(Lesley:)You're welcome.

13
00:00:29,166 --> 00:00:31,336
(Sheldon:)You did this?

14
00:00:31,501 --> 00:00:34,501
(Lesley:)Yeah. I noticed it when I got up
to get water, so I fixed it.

15
00:00:34,671 --> 00:00:37,761
Now you can show quarks are
asymptotically free at high energies.

16
00:00:37,924 --> 00:00:39,384
(Lesley:)Pretty cool, huh?

17
00:00:41,136 --> 00:00:42,846
"Cool"?

18
00:00:43,388 --> 00:00:44,848
Listen, I gotta get to the lab.

19
00:00:45,015 --> 00:00:47,015
(Lesley:)Thanks for a great night.

20
00:00:48,059 --> 00:00:49,639
(Leonard:)Thank you. I'll see you at work.

21
00:00:50,562 --> 00:00:53,272
(Sheldon:)- Hold on. Hold on.
- What?

22
00:00:53,440 --> 00:00:56,360
- Who told you you could touch my board?
- No one.

23
00:00:56,526 --> 00:00:59,066
(Sheldon:)I don't come into your house
and touch your board.

24
00:00:59,237 --> 00:01:04,027
(Lesley:)There are no incorrect equations
on my board.

